.TH randicmp6 8 2026-02-07 THC IPv6 ATTACK TOOLKIT
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.B randicmp6

Sends all ICMPv6 type and code combinations to destination.
Option -s  sets the source IPv6 address.
Option -p  will not print answers received.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
thc-ipv6 was written by van Hauser <vh@thc.org> / THC

The homepage for this toolkit is: https://github.com/vanhauser-thc/thc-ipv6

.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
Syntax: ./randicmp6 [-p] [-s sourceip] interface destination [type [code]]
